WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.302
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.770
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.438
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.673
Government regulators
on Friday

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.743
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:12.078
the country's 16th largest bank,

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:16.115
after it quickly became
the 178th largest bank.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:18.184
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.086
That's right,
government regulators on Friday

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.954
seized control
of Silicon Valley Bank,

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:25.191
making it the largest
U.S. bank failure since 2008.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.459
And come to think of it,

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:29.863
it was always a bad sign
that their ATM had a tip screen.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.065
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.733
President Biden spoke
this morning

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:37.136
about Friday's collapse
of Silicon Valley Bank

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:38.170
and reassured Americans

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.172
the country's financial system
is safe.

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:43.476
But remember, this is a guy
whose whole financial system

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.212
is definitely a coffee can
on a high shelf.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.446
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:51.083
"See, the thing is, they never
look up there."

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.219
That's right. President Biden
reassured Americans

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.953
the country's
financial system is safe.

00:00:54.953 --> 00:00:56.389
Okay, I think the fact

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:58.591
that you're talking
about a bank collapse

00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.592
proves it isn't.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.827
That's like going to a funeral

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:04.964
and giving a eulogy about
how Nana's going to be fine.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.336
The Oscars were held
last night,

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.438
and the film "Everything
Everywhere All At Once"

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:14.740
won seven awards,
including Best Picture.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.710
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:19.612
Best Picture, Best Actress,

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.415
and worst butchering
in a text from your mom.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.451
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:29.155
That's right. "Everything
Everywhere All At Once"

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:31.457
won best picture at last
night's Academy Awards.

00:01:31.457 --> 00:01:34.727
As for who lost -- whoever sat
behind this lady.

00:01:34.727 --> 00:01:36.162
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.297
"Oh, my goodness.

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:42.001
My first Oscars.
My first Oscars."

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.037
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:48.273
When asked last week
about allegations

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:51.244
that he participated
in a credit-card skimming scam,

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.879
New York Congressman
George Santos said

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:56.115
he was innocent and added,
"I'm no mastermind of anything,"

00:01:56.115 --> 00:02:00.018
which is maybe the first
believable thing he's ever said.

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:01.320
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:05.191
Elon Musk is reportedly
planning to build a town

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:08.995
outside Austin, Texas, for his
Tesla and SpaceX employees

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.897
that he has described
in meetings as a utopia.

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:12.932
I don't know.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:14.400
Have you ever been to a party

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.002
where one guy has a Tesla?

00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:19.539
Now imagine every guy
has a Tesla.

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:21.040
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.342
A tattoo artist in India

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.943
recently set
a Guinness world record

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:26.279
after spending
over 90 consecutive hours

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.248
giving tattoos to 64 people

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:30.883
and hepatitis to 63 people.

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:32.919
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.957
Today was National K9
Veterans Day.

00:02:38.957 --> 00:02:42.495
It's like regular Veterans Day,
except no fireworks.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.531
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:49.969
We have a writer, Mike Scollins,

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:53.906
who's obsessed with the idea
that dogs don't like fireworks.

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:57.710
A lot of his jokes are dependent
upon people knowing that.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.912
And caring.

00:03:00.546 --> 00:03:02.582
And finally, according to
a new study,

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:06.018
reusable water bottles
can have 14 times more bacteria

00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:07.052
than a pet's water bowl,

00:03:07.052 --> 00:03:09.255
but only because your cat drinks
out of it

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.823
every time you turn your back.

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.058
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.058 --> 00:03:13.726
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

